      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Newnham Road began as a stock route linking southern farms to Cannon Hill saleyards before becoming a regular road in the 1960s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
